          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria' fontsize='14'>Average driver income increases substantially with education level. Customers with PhD-level education have the highest average income, while customers with less than high school education have the lowest.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
